WEBVTT

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.440
What is this for?

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.280
The recital?

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.480
I am the greatest criminal mind
of the century.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:49.480
I don't go to little girls'
dance recitals!

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:14.200
Opening launch bay doors.
Commencing launch sequence.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:19.080
And we are good to go
in T minus 10 seconds.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:24.400
Ten, nine, eight, seven,

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.480
six...

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:51.680
Oh, yeah!

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:56.000
Nice work, Doctor. All systems go.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.440
Boo-ya!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:09.760
My flight suit.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.480
Oh, yeah! Once again, the mighty...

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:37.480
I've got it!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.640
I've got the moon!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.400
I've got the moon!

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.320
I can make it!

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.520
- Wait a minute!
- Kevin!

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:14.040
Come on, come on!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.480
He's still not here.

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.880
Why would he come? He gave us up.

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.440
But he pinkie promised!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.160
Girls, girls, places!

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.880
No, we can't start yet!
We're still expecting someone.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.280
Can we just wait
a few more minutes?

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:41.280
All right.
But just a few more minutes.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.360
He's not coming, guys.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.600
Gru! Gru, can you hear me?

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:54.240
Quick, we have to warn him,
and fast!

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.720
Okay, okay. There's the library.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.400
That's Third Street.
The dance studio...

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.840
There! There! There it is!

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.080
Sorry, buddy. Show's over.

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.960
Over?

